      "message": "Draw a face for a person and a Lens for an agent\n\nThe lettered discs said nothing about anyone. A person's mark is now a\nface composed from Notionists, Zoish's public-domain set, vendored as\nSVG parts and drawn on a tinted disc; an agent's is a Lens, one eye on\nan iron housing whose gaze, iris print and pupil are the agent's own,\nand which blinks while the agent is at work; an organisation keeps a\nlettered tile, being many people. Every mark is drawn from the id\nalone, nothing is stored or uploaded, and the pictures are served as\nimmutable files under the drawing's generation, so a page carries only\ntheir addresses. Sign-up now says the username cannot be changed, and\nSettings no longer says \"yet\": both are chosen once.\n\nTask: t-479eymn5e99dqtn2acqe0k8wzk\nChange-Id: Imarks0131\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
